# Default sorethumb workspace (P3-5) and its artefacts. Anchored: a
# workspace explicitly created at "." (the pre-P3-5 default, or via
# `--workdir .`) produces these same top-level names, and unanchored
# patterns would also match same-named directories anywhere else in the tree.
/sorethumb-workspace/
/sorethumb.db
/models/
/results/
/reports/
/logs/
/cache/
.sorethumb_benchmark_cache/
benchmark_results/
/validation/
/tmp/
.idea/
*.iml
prompts/
PLAN.md

# Generated or hand-written review documents (code reviews, audits of the repository,
# pre-release critiques). They are working material about the project, not part of it, and
# were never meant to be published; the [Rr][Ee]... classes make the match case-insensitive.
/reviews/
*[Rr][Ee][Vv][Ii][Ee][Ww]*.md
*[Rr][Ee][Vv][Ii][Ee][Ww]*.docx
*[Rr][Ee][Vv][Ii][Ee][Ww]*.pdf
